Changes
================================================================================

The files in this product have been modified from the originals. The changes
are structural rather than incidental:

  Tools          Rewritten. The tool set, the names, the arguments, the
                 descriptions and the implementations are Nakka's own.

  Permissions    Rewritten. Three modes — Manual, Plan, Auto — with a
                 per-command safety classifier, and a plan mode enforced
                 read-only at the policy layer rather than by convention.

  Webview        Rebuilt. Transcript, input, tool rows, permission prompts,
                 diff view, session header and history.

  Providers      Reduced to Anthropic, OpenAI-compatible endpoints and Ollama.
                 The hosted registry, remote configuration and account layer
                 were removed.

  Build          No longer downloads anything from Continue Dev, Inc.
                 infrastructure. Native binaries come from their own upstream
                 projects.

  Text           Every user-facing string is Nakka's own.

